### Test Login API with your actual user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kuralarasan1905@gmail.com",
  "password": "YourActualPassword"
}

### Test Notes API with JWT Token (replace TOKEN_HERE with actual token from login response)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notes/test
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE

### Create Note with JWT Token
POST http://localhost:5000/api/notes/addNotes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE

{
  "title": "Test Note with JWT",
  "content": "This note is created with proper JWT authentication",
  "color": "#FFF9C4"
}

### Get Notes List with JWT Token
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notes/getNotesList
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE
